OL,3,GNEWSAHomeless man living in nature
OL,4,Areserve for months
OL,5,
OL,6,FA homeless man has been living in a
OL,7,Fmakeshift camp in a Lincolnshire nature
OL,8,Freserve for five months amid calls for
OL,9,Fthe council to help him find
OL,10,Faccommodation.
OL,12,FResidents nearby have raised concerns
OL,13,Fabout fires being lit in the woods,
OL,14,Fnoise disturbances, littering and their
OL,15,Fpersonal safety.
OL,17,FStan said he was living there because
OL,18,Fit was safe as "not too many people can
OL,19,Fsee him" and he had to start fires in
OL,20,Forder to cook, dry clothes and keep
OL,21,Fwarm.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
