OL,3,GNEWSAHomeless man living in nature
OL,4,Areserve for months
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Lincolnshire Council leader Rob
OL,7,FWaltham said: "In a tolerant community,
OL,8,Fthe response should be to work
OL,9,Ftogether... to support this
OL,10,Findividual." However, the council would
OL,11,Fnot comment further on the case.
